@startuml
title Local-First Synchronisation Order (~--local-first)

start
:Validate authentication, service reachability\nand system time safety gates;

:Process known database state against\nthe local filesystem first;
note right
  Detect and action locally modified or
  deleted objects that were previously tracked.
end note

:Scan local filesystem for new data;
:Upload eligible new local files / directories;

:Reconcile Microsoft OneDrive online state;
note right
  Remote reconciliation still applies after
  the local pass. ~--local-first changes ordering;
  it does not disable conflict protection.
end note

:Apply remaining online changes locally;
stop
@enduml
